=== {{S|étymologie}} ===
: Composé de ''{{lien|bath|en}}'' et de ''{{lien|room|en}}''.

=== {{S|nom|en}} ===
{{en-nom-rég|ˈbæθ.ɹum|ˈbɑːθ.ɹuːm}}
[[Image:Bathroom in the Beamish Museum 01.JPG|thumb|A '''bathroom''' (1).]]
[[Image:Notariskantoor Valkenswaard 10.JPG|thumb|A '''bathroom'''.&nbsp;(2)]]
'''bathroom''' {{pron|ˈbæθ.ɹum|en}} {{US|nocat=1}}, {{pron|ˈbɑːθ.ɹuːm|en}} {{UK|nocat=1}}
# [[salle de bains|Salle de bains]].
#* {{exemple | lang=en | This house has three '''bathrooms'''.}}
# {{US|en}} {{Canada|en}} {{par euphémisme|en}} [[toilettes|Toilettes]].
#* {{exemple | lang=en | I have to go to the '''bathroom'''.}}

==== {{S|synonymes}} ====
''Toilettes publiques'' :
* {{lien|restroom|en}} {{US|nocat=1}}
* {{lien|washroom|en}} {{Canada|nocat=1}}
''Toilettes : ''
: {{cf}} ''[[toilet#Synonymes|toilet]]

==== {{S|dérivés}} ====
* {{lien|bathroom tissue|en}} ''(papier hygiénique)''

=== {{S|prononciation}} ===
